        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umukozi yunguka iki mu butame bwiwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabonye umutwaro Imana yaremetse abantu twese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yatumye ikintu cose kiba ciza mu gihe caco. Kandi yashizeho ibihe bidashira mu mitima y’abantu; ariko ntibashobora gutahura ivyo Imana yakoze kuva mu ntango gushika kw’iherezo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndazi ko ku bantu ata kiruta kunezerwa no gukora ivyiza bakiriho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyi ni yo ngabire y’Imana, ni uko umuntu wese arya akanywa, agahimba mu bivuye mu butame bwiwe bwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndazi ko ivyo Imana ikora bizohoraho ibihe vyose; nta na kimwe cokwongerwako kuri vyo kandi nta na kimwe cokurwako. Imana yabikoze gutyo kugira ngo abantu bayubahe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi hari n’ikindi kintu nabonye musi y’izuba:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nariyumviriye mu mutima wanje nti:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nariyumviriye kandi nti: “n’abantu na bo, Imana irabapima ngo bamenye ko bameze nk’ibikoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibishikira abantu ni nk’ibishikira ibikoko; nta tandukaniro kuri vyompi: uko kimwe gipfa ni ko n’ikindi gipfa. Vyose bifise impwemu zimwe; nta co umuntu arushije igikoko. Vyose ni ubusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vyose bija mu kibanza kimwe; vyose biva mu mukungugu, kandi bigasubira mu mukungugu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni nde azi ko impwemu z’abantu ziduga mw’ijuru, canke impwemu z’ibikoko zimanuka zija i kuzimu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko mbona ko ata kintu kiruta ko umuntu anezererwa igikorwa ciwe, kuko ari vyo yagerewe. None ni nde azomuha kubona ibizobaho inyuma yiwe?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
